00:10:53.020 --> 00:11:09.419
Kevin Millikin: Yeah, I agree, and I do… I do think they are orthogonal. I would say that having numeric new types is not really the killer app for new type. It's… you can have structs or arrays that you just wanted to guarantee were produced by your

