00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:56.069
Thomas Kerber: Yes, I… I'm not sure what I'm advocating for.

138
00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:59.990
Thomas Kerber: I'm… I'm just worried about.

139
00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:04.250
